{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrol is a grand strategy game focused on capturing and holding strategic resources. The objective is simple: control all resources and destroy rival empires.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture Resources:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The empire that controls a resource receives a yield at the end of each round. These resources can be used to build and upgrade towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/856244ddbd596ed09544b36e96b4692d.avif?t=1757528956\" alt=\"Capture Resources\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Upgrade Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different towers require distinct resources to unluck. Each tower type has unique strengths and weaknesses, so spend your resources wisely to optimize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/b1f2bcd1bde3e1338a6afdd230e9b6ac.avif?t=1757528956\" alt=\"Different Tower Types\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Enemy Territory:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your towers and build more to expand your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/a5249d15c29f58892cec301d0e3b33f5.avif?t=1757528956\" alt=\"Expand your Territory\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>German law blah blah...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Impressum:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Max Krupp</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Max-Planck Str. 2 </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>68809 Neulu\u00dfheim, Germany</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Email: contact@maxkrupp.de</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Telefon Nummer: +4915756641541</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Umsatzsteuer-ID gem. \u00a7 27a UStG: DE454305488</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865430?t=1757528956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/24c5c1b07c2fea4fc9b7829f81f43fc702c7e0da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757528956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/9e190802b644e353d0aea5f4c351f9825bfab80f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757528956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/9e190802b644e353d0aea5f4c351f9825bfab80f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757528956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrol is a grand strategy game focused on capturing and holding strategic resources. The objective is simple: control all resources and destroy rival empires.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture Resources:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The empire that controls a resource receives a yield at the end of each round. These resources can be used to build and upgrade towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865